r approval nor authorisation by that date.","name":"pending_pre_effective_application","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u9.1696","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"}],"result":"(and (>= assessment_date (date 2025-11-28)) home_requirements_met (not (or novel_features complex_features possible_local_policy_implications)) (not pending_pre_effective_application))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and defined_ucits_fund post_authorisation_change material_investment_change)"},"local_id":"removal_eligibility","questions":["Does the transition preserve substantive approval requirements as assumed, or only administrative processing?","What further qualifications do the referenced FAQs place on the selected removal?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, true means the selected material investment change qualifies for removal of SFC prior approval under item (ii), on the proposed transition reading: the assessment is on or after 28 November 2025, home requirements are met, no novel or complex product features or possible local policy implications are involved, and no pre-effective pending application retains the existing process. False means this particular removal is unavailable under this reading; it does not independently establish an approval obligation or non-compliance. Unknown inputs remain unknown. Continuing notification and post-vetting obligations are outside this predicate.","subject":"Eligibility of a selected material UCITS investment change for removal of SFC prior approval"},"protocol":"legalmath.search.v1","role":"adversarial-investigator","source_packet":{"authority":"RETAINED_SOURCE","dependencies":[{"dependency_id":"missing.1c25ffdf5c1e10e0297748d5","source_hash":null},{"dependency_id":"missing.79fb54125bb1f35a1d457fad","source_hash":null}],"family_ids":["scope","definitions","exceptions","modality","time","dependencies"],"selected_slice":"Does a material change in a UCITS fund investment objective, policy or restriction require prior SFC approval under this circular, taking account of product features, home requirements and the application transition?","source_key":"assurance.4ab832cf6eb51393902df2bf","units":[{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2:185","normative":true,"span":{"end":185,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u0.2","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b05484326a5409e0f778c605bceb798122a1d7c8053dcb52c3cc6d0f058c98fc","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) regularly reviews its operational processes and guidance to ensure their efficiency without compromising investor interests and protection.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u0.2"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 190:519","normative":true,"span":{"end":519,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u1.190","page":1,"quote_sha256":"6b12d6c0f8954dda7bf744822668a508b908697f1527d6e3129afa66a0cb261a","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":190,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"The SFC has further streamlined measures for processing certain post-authorisation matters for UCITS funds1, following its review and engagement with market participants. These measures aim at facilitating UCITS funds in implementing changes that are subject to their home regulator’s supervision, and will take immediate effect.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u1.190"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 523:567","normative":true,"span":{"end":567,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u2.523","page":1,"quote_sha256":"79cfc2bdc8cf73658858fbedda8fa1c8e02083ef03416c48e19a3b3cdd61bb44","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":523,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Further streamlined measures for UCITS funds","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u2.523"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 575:651","normative":true,"span":{"end":651,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u3.575","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f3ff17acfa0e7dd0d2d11148ac213328c1e1e5d1bbcddc5121c05968817548ef","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":575,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"The key streamlined measures cover the following post-authorisation matters:","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u3.575"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 653:838","normative":true,"span":{"end":838,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u4.653","page":1,"quote_sha256":"16fe8181147b7a5bca6aa5706c45d63547269aa88ced05fd83979842675b5dc3","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":653,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"(i)        Change of key operators – Removing the SFC’s requirement on prior approval for change of depository and investment delegates which are under the home regulator’s supervision.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u4.653"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 840:1219","normative":true,"span":{"end":1219,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u5.840","page":1,"quote_sha256":"e924d6ef6b60fd1b62d6427a511ae2cc4855b916b71eabbd5fff4846bb3f04d0","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":840,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"(ii)       Material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions – Removing the SFC’s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u5.840"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1221:1414","normative":true,"span":{"end":1414,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u6.1221","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b214c05d1c35bece70b08892e935bd96f29f348208aaecfb45fcf6e1e51b81ce","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":1221,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"(iii)      Post-authorisation notifications – To align the SFC’s notification requirements with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, including the notice periods and content requirements.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u6.1221"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1419:1675","normative":true,"span":{"end":1675,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u7.1419","page":1,"quote_sha256":"e51f0fd2001923f9c2dd0dfd3935561f6d192a6e8d99e2a2a784b78e4681d636","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":1419,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"The SFC has updated and published on its website relevant FAQs2 , including a revamped FAQ on SFC Authorization of UCITS Funds to facilitate UCITS fund managers in navigating post-authorisation compliance matters, as well as related forms and checklists3 .","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u7.1419"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1677:1691","normative":true,"span":{"end":1691,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u8.1677","page":1,"quote_sha256":"1cff7713912f5d538506c1ba82db75b7caabcd0ee2dc4abee6bbd4db5878233e","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":1677,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Implementation","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u8.1677"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1696:1804","normative":true,"span":{"end":1804,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u9.1696","page":1,"quote_sha256":"fb0182e8746a0ef9172990e70c357cda13b223fec0ed72f5a2baf0405ffe12a6","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":1696,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs will take effect on 28 November 2025 (Effective Date).","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1809:2028","normative":true,"span":{"end":2028,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u10.1809","page":1,"quote_sha256":"dfed4e2d2316df8ad47163dbc3855ec26331c4b7b38a58bc75220b6651988774","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":1809,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2030:2064","normative":true,"span":{"end":2064,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u11.2030","page":1,"quote_sha256":"8755027d3624aabe4e0f13fe4c2caf4836b7c5d45a2a107f563e3b04e3243778","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2030,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Obligation of management companies","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u11.2030"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2069:2372","normative":true,"span":{"end":2372,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u12.2069","page":1,"quote_sha256":"00a3ef2d8ea613c31c4bc187ef29bc54f93ac2813ed02bb1752b4b88983c6c3a","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2069,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"The SFC will continue to conduct post-vetting of scheme changes (including those not subject to the SFC’s prior approval) and related revised documents filed with the SFC. It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u12.2069"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2377:2486","normative":true,"span":{"end":2486,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u13.2377","page":1,"quote_sha256":"46fac10f5d9939189f3e040023d7f67903dc093574d00405421d8bfa051558c2","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2377,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Should you wish to clarify any aspects of this circular, please contact the relevant case officers in charge.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u13.2377"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2489:2517","normative":true,"span":{"end":2517,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u14.2489","page":1,"quote_sha256":"2262a17aa8ece28244aedc22e1f37fce7075bbeb018d04e4b3b36c1c9d0199ce","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2489,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Investment Products Division","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u14.2489"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2518:2551","normative":true,"span":{"end":2551,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u15.2518","page":1,"quote_sha256":"88e2bc94e9edc39f2ac1cdaaea86b44ab5ea59b31c446f69591f21bf460b005e","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2518,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u15.2518"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2556:2829","normative":true,"span":{"end":2829,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u17.2556","page":1,"quote_sha256":"8fbe2ff0c63ac687d1c454dff852bc02614d55243330fc29e2224ed902a018cb","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2556,"text_sha256":"dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"},"text":"1 For this circular, UCITS funds means (i) Undertakings for Collective Investment in Transferable Securities (UCITS) domiciled in France, Luxembourg, Ireland and the Netherlands, and (ii) collective investment schemes domiciled in the United Kingdom authorised as UK UCITS.","unit_id":"d97b56331f41a.u17.2556"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2831:2912","normative":true,"span":{"end":2912,"id":"s.d97b56331f41a.u18.2831","page":1,"quote_sha256":"1165f873c1ac724cdaae7845afde205f9199c72b43e8a65fedfd87e50a170021","raw_sha256":"dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf","source_id":"d97b56331f41a","start":2831,"text_sh